*        |      NWELL/PSUB         |      nwdio      |
*        |-------------------------------------------|      
*        |     Native N+/PWELL     | nndio18| nndio33|
*        |-------------------------------------------|
*        | Buried PWELL/Deep NWELL |     diobpw      |
*        *-------------------------------------------*
*
*    Valid temperature range is from -40C to 125C
